            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element Name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>AppProtocol</td><td>complexType:AppProtocolTyperefer to Table 29</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC for transmitting the list of supported protocols. Each protocol with a particular version supported by the EVCC is represented by one AppProtocol entry in the request message (maximum number of entries: 20).</td></tr></table>",
