        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element Name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>ProtocolNamespace</td><td>simpleType: protocolNamespaceType refer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC to uniquely identify the Namespace URI of a specific protocol supported by the EVCC, i.e. this is the protocol name of the related protocol.</td></tr><tr><td>VersionNumberMajor</td><td>simpleType xs:unsignedInt</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC to indicate the major version number of the protocol indicated in the message element ProtocolNamespace. The protocol version will be incremented after every new release of the document.</td></tr><tr><td>VersionNumberMinor</td><td>simpleType: xs:unsignedInt</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC to indicate the minor version number of the protocol indicated in the message element ProtocolNamespace.</td></tr><tr><td>SchemaID</td><td>simpleType: idType refer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC to indicate the SchemaID assigned by the EVCC to the protocol indicated in the message element ProtocolNamespace, VersionNumberMajor and VersionNumberMinor.</td></tr><tr><td>Priority</td><td>simpleType: priorityType refer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>This message element is used by the EVCC for indicating the protocol priority of a specific protocol allowing the SECC to select a protocol based on priorities. See also [V2G20-167].</td></tr></table>",
